000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          CFINDJCW.
000400 AUTHOR.              C I HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        10/26/89.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*
001000*REMARKS. THIS PROGRAM RETREIVES THE JCW ASKED FOR.  THE
001100*         PARAMETERS OF THIS PROGRAM WILL BE THE SAME IN BOTH
001200*         THE IBM AND THE HP VERSIONS, SO THAT THE CALLING
001300*         PROGRAM WILL BE PORTABLE.  ALSO, FOR 0/1 YES/NO
001400*         JCWS, THIS PROGRAM WILL RETURN A 'Y' OR 'N' FLAG, WHERE
001500*         ZERO = 'N' AND 1 = 'Y', AND NON-EXISTANT = 'N'.
029800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
029900 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
030000 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS400.
030100 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS400.
030200 SPECIAL-NAMES. LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
030400
031400 DATA DIVISION.
038000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY JCWAREA IN COPYCSIS.
       01  JCW-AREA-REDEF REDEFINES MC-LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
           05  JCW-BYTE OCCURS 512 TIMES PIC X(1).
       01  SUB                     PIC 9(4) BINARY.
       01  SUB2                    PIC 9(4) BINARY.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  JCW-PARMS.
           05  JCW-NAME            PIC X(16).
           05  JCW-VALUE-AREA.
               10  JCW-VALUE OCCURS 4 TIMES PIC X(1).
           05  JCW-YES-NO          PIC X(1).
           05  JCW-STATUS          PIC 9(4).
           05  JCW-STARTING-POS    PIC 9(4).
           05  JCW-LENGTH          PIC 9(1).

068300 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING JCW-PARMS.
068500 6000-MAIN.
           IF JCW-LENGTH NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE 1 TO JCW-LENGTH.
           ACCEPT MC-LOCAL-DATA-AREA FROM LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
           MOVE JCW-STARTING-POS TO SUB.
           MOVE ZERO TO SUB2.
           PERFORM 4 TIMES
               ADD 1 TO SUB2
               IF SUB2 <= JCW-LENGTH
                   MOVE JCW-BYTE (SUB) TO JCW-VALUE (SUB2)
               ELSE
                   MOVE SPACES TO JCW-VALUE (SUB2)
               END-IF
               ADD 1 TO SUB
           END-PERFORM.
           IF JCW-VALUE (1) = "Y" OR "1"
               MOVE "Y" TO JCW-YES-NO
           ELSE
               MOVE "N" TO JCW-YES-NO.

       6990-MAIN-X.
           GOBACK.
